// Embeds ..\check_mk.manifest (requestedExecutionLevel asInvoker + the
// supportedOS GUIDs) as an application manifest. Resource ID 1 is
// CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID, type 24 is RT_MANIFEST. Kept in its own
// .rc so the shared check_mk_service.rc stays free of RT_MANIFEST: the MSBuild
// build embeds the very same manifest through the vcxproj <Manifest> tool, and
// a second copy there would trip CVT1100 (duplicate resource).
1 24 "check_mk.manifest"
